      "description": "## Overview\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Out-of-bounds Read in the `Decoding` process of BMP files containing a palette with out-of-range indices. An attacker can cause a panic and potentially disrupt application availability by supplying a crafted BMP file with invalid palette indices.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `golang.org/x/image/bmp` to version 0.41.0 or higher.\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/golang/image/commit/0d61147654dcd60265f4bfa72e5f66f578630e22)\n- [Go Advisory](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-5031)\n- [Go Commit](https://go.dev/cl/781500)\n- [Go Issue](https://go.dev/issue/79576)\n- [Google Groups Forum](https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/uhYX90BlBvI)\n",
